  "prompt": "For each Earbuds product (category_id 16) sold in 2025, how many units sold with a promotion and how many without one? A line has a promotion when order_lines.promo_id is not missing. order_ts holds UTC time, and 2025 runs from 1 January to 31 December in UTC. Return three columns, in this order: product_id, promo_units and full_price_units. A product with no units of a kind shows 0 there. Return one row for each Earbuds product sold in 2025. Any row order is fine.",
